
#### 2.1.7. Difference Tests
In the final round of our analysis we estimated difference tests of network centrality indices and edge-weights to compare node importance. Difference tests are proposed by [@Epskamp2017; @Epskamp2017a]. These tests accomplish difference testing by using non-parametric bootstrap estimates of the centrality indices and edge-weights.


### 3.6 Difference tests
The *bootnet* R package offers the *differenceTest* function to perform non-parametric bootstrap (bootstrapping with replacements). 

```{r message=FALSE, warning=FALSE, include=FALSE}
